      "changes": {
        "isHiring": {
          "before": false,
          "after": true
        },
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Aside is an AI browser that completes real work across the websites you already use. It can sign in through your browser, work inside email, dashboards, internal tools, docs, and spreadsheets, and keep going when a task takes minutes or hours.\r\n\r\nUnlike agents that depend on integrations, Aside uses the web the way you do. Browsing history becomes local memory, so it knows which tools and context matter. Its password manager lets agents autofill credentials without exposing secrets to the AI. Sensitive actions like payments, posts, and messages wait for your approval.\r\n\r\nAside achieved a state-of-the-art on agentic browsing tasks. Aside is ranked #1 across Mind2Web, Odyssey, bu-bench-v1, outperforming Claude Cowork and ChatGPT Atlas's result.",
          "after": "Aside is an AI browser that completes real work across the websites you already use. It can sign in through your browser, work inside email, dashboards, internal tools, docs, and spreadsheets, and keep going when a task takes minutes or hours.\r\n\r\nUnlike agents that depend on integrations, Aside uses the web the way you do. Browsing history becomes local memory, so it knows which tools and context matter. Its password manager lets agents autofill credentials without exposing secrets to the AI. Sensitive actions like payments, posts, and messages wait for your approval.\r\n\r\nWe achieved state-of-the-art on agentic browsing benchmarks, surpassing OpenAI and Anthropic's result- Aside ranked #1 across Mind2Web, Odyssey, bu-bench-v1."
        },
        "question_answers": {
